      "content": "That wording is perfect. It's exactly what we need to keep this moving.\n\nOne last thing—since you're recommending we treat the 90mph reading as an anomaly, I'll need to sign off on the technical justification part of the file too. If the internal compliance team asks why we aren't requesting a hardware calibration report for the telematics unit, what should my official response be in the logs? I want to make sure our reasoning is consistent with the summary you just wrote.",
